OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Cyril Scott
OL,6,     F4/5. Donald Macleod journeys
OL,7,     Fthrough the life of Cyril Scott
OL,8,     Fduring the 1930s and Second World
OL,9,     FWar, when Scott was in demand as a
OL,10,     Fconcert pianist, but later faced
OL,11,     Ffinancial hardship.
